# Upload only the built sites. Each Vercel project points its Root Directory at one of these
# folders, so anything not un-ignored here is stripped before the build and the deployment ends
# up empty (symptom: every path 404s while the deployment still reports Ready in ~1s).
#
# ADD A NEW SITE HERE TOO. A folder missing from this list cannot deploy, no matter how the
# project is configured.
*
!site
!site/**
!site-gt
!site-gt/**
!vercel.json
